</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#D9668C;--ltx-fill-color:#F5D9E2;" fill="#F5D9E2" stroke="#D9668C" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 182.27 16.24 L 93.32 16.24 C 91.79 16.24 90.55 15 90.55 13.47 L 90.55 -13.47 C 90.55 -15 91.79 -16.24 93.32 -16.24 L 182.27 -16.24 C 183.8 -16.24 185.04 -15 185.04 -13.47 L 185.04 13.47 C 185.04 15 183.8 16.24 182.27 16.24 Z M 90.55 -16.24"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 94.49 5.9)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.36em;--ltx-fo-height:0.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.4em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.94" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.56)" width="101.84"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
