<td id="S5.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">63.4±0.5</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">39.7±0.4</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">–</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">   w/o <math id="S5.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{stab}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{stab}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">62.5±0.7</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">39.1±0.6</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-0.9</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">   w/o <math id="S5.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{mm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">62.1±0.6</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">38.8±0.5</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-1.3</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">   w/o <math id="S5.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{recon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{recon}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">62.8±0.5</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">39.3±0.4</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-0.6</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">   w/o <math id="S5.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{faith}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{faith}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">62.6±0.6</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">39.2±0.5</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">-0.8</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Modality robustness.</h4>

<div id="S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate robustness by systematically dropping modalities at test time. Our gating mechanism ensures graceful degradation: performance drops by only 0.8% when visual features are missing and 1.6% when text is missing, demonstrating the effectiveness of our multimodal fusion design.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Robustness to missing modalities (Beauty, Hit@10, %).</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
